{"seq":3,"slug":"case-control-studies","title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 病例对照研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/study-design/case-control-studies","wordCount":2118,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-临床研究方法-病例对照研究\">研究生 临床研究方法 — 病例对照研究</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>病例对照研究（Case-Control Study）从结局出发回溯暴露历史，是流行病学研究中效率最高的设计之一。其基本逻辑是：选择已发生疾病的&quot;病例&quot;（Cases）和未发生疾病的&quot;对照&quot;（Controls），比较两组过去的暴露史，通过比值比（Odds Ratio, OR）间接估计暴露与疾病的关联强度。与队列研究相比，病例对照研究特别适合研究罕见疾病，因为它不需要追踪大量人群等待少量事件发生。</p>\n<p>病例对照研究的核心设计逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>逆向追溯</strong>：从结局（疾病状态）出发追溯暴露历史，时间方向与因果链条相反</li>\n<li><strong>对照选择</strong>：对照应来自产生病例的同一&quot;源人群&quot;（Source Population），这是估计无偏 OR 的根本前提</li>\n<li><strong>比值比（OR）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OR} = \\frac{a/c}{b/d} = \\frac{ad}{bc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> = 暴露病例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> = 暴露对照，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> = 非暴露病例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> = 非暴露对照</li>\n<li><strong>罕见疾病假设</strong>：当疾病发生率较低（通常 &lt;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>）时，OR 近似等于相对危险度 RR</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解病例对照研究的一个关键认知：它不是队列研究的&quot;低级替代品&quot;，而是一种独立的、在特定情境下具有独特优势的研究设计。现代病例对照方法学（尤其是基于密度采样的嵌套病例对照）已经超越了传统教科书中的简化描述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"对照选择的方法论\">对照选择的方法论</h3><p>对照选择是病例对照研究设计中最关键也是最容易出错的环节。对照必须能够代表产生病例的源人群中的暴露分布。如果一个对照成员发生了该疾病，他应该有资格成为病例——这就是&quot;可能成为病例原则&quot;（Would Criterion）。</p>\n<p>对照来源的主要类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对照类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人群对照</td>\n<td>源人群的随机样本</td>\n<td>代表性最佳</td>\n<td>响应率低，联系困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>医院对照</td>\n<td>同一医院的其他疾病患者</td>\n<td>便于招募，回忆动机相当</td>\n<td>选择偏倚（Berkson 偏倚）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻居/朋友对照</td>\n<td>病例推荐</td>\n<td>控制社会经济混杂</td>\n<td>过匹配风险，暴露同质性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死亡对照</td>\n<td>死于其他原因的个体</td>\n<td>适用于致死性疾病</td>\n<td>信息来源受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>密度采样</strong>（Density Sampling / Incidence Density Sampling）是现代病例对照方法学的重要进展。在一个动态队列中，每当一个病例发生时，从同一时刻仍处于&quot;风险集&quot;中的成员中随机抽取对照。这种采样策略下的 OR 直接等于发病率比（Incidence Rate Ratio），不需要罕见疾病假设。</p>\n<p><strong>病例-队列设计</strong>（Case-Cohort Design）是密度采样的变体，在研究开始时从整个队列中随机抽取一个&quot;子队列&quot;（Subcohort）作为所有后续病例的共同对照池。这种设计的优势是子队列只需进行一次暴露测量，效率更高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"偏倚的识别与控制\">偏倚的识别与控制</h3><p><strong>回忆偏倚</strong>（Recall Bias）是病例对照研究面临的标志性偏倚。患病者可能比健康对照更仔细地回忆过去的暴露史（尤其是与疾病相关的暴露），导致暴露在病例中被过度报告。减轻策略包括：使用客观暴露记录（医疗记录、生物标志物）、对暴露评估者实施盲法、选择新发病例（减少疾病-暴露认知影响的时间）。</p>\n<p><strong>选择偏倚</strong>的来源多样：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Berkson 偏倚</strong>：使用医院对照时，如果暴露因素同时增加了病例疾病和对照疾病的住院概率，会虚假地增强关联</li>\n<li><strong>存活偏倚</strong>：如果暴露同时影响疾病发生和疾病预后，使用现患病例（Prevalent Cases）可能遗漏那些暴露后快速死亡或痊愈的个体</li>\n<li><strong>检测偏倚</strong>：暴露因素增加了疾病被诊断的概率（而非发生率），如医疗监测频率差异</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>混杂控制</strong>在设计阶段可通过匹配实现。匹配（Matching）为每个病例选择在特定混杂因素上相似的对照。但匹配不等于控制混杂——匹配后的分析<strong>必须</strong>使用条件逻辑回归（Conditional Logistic Regression），否则匹配效应本身会引入偏倚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log\\left(\\frac{P(Y=1|X)}{P(Y=0|X)}\\right) = \\alpha_s + \\beta_1 X_1 + \\beta_2 X_2 + \\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.313em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是匹配层（stratum）特异的截距。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高级设计变体\">高级设计变体</h3><p><strong>病例-交叉设计</strong>（Case-Crossover Design）由 Maclure 在1991年提出，用于研究短暂暴露触发急性事件的效应。每个病例既是自己的病例（事件发生前的时间窗口）又是自己的对照（更早的参考时间窗口），完全消除了个体间混杂。这一设计特别适用于研究空气污染、温度变化和药物使用对心肌梗死等急性事件的触发作用。</p>\n<p><strong>病例-时间-对照设计</strong>（Case-Time-Control Design）在病例-交叉设计基础上增加了对照组的对应时间窗口比较，进一步控制了暴露随时间的趋势性变化。</p>\n<p><strong>两阶段病例对照设计</strong>（Two-Phase Case-Control）在大规模筛查数据（第一阶段）中选取子样本进行详细测量（第二阶段），结合逆概率加权实现高效估计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"效应量估计与统计分析\">效应量估计与统计分析</h3><p>非匹配病例对照研究的基本分析使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 四格表：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext> CI: </mtext><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>OR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1.96</mn><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OR} = \\frac{ad}{bc}, \\quad 95\\% \\text{ CI: } \\exp\\left(\\ln(\\text{OR}) \\pm 1.96\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}+\\frac{1}{c}+\\frac{1}{d}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> CI: </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OR</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6516em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6116em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7884em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Mantel-Haenszel 方法用于分层分析，提供混杂调整后的汇总 OR 和同质性检验。</p>\n<p>多变量非条件逻辑回归用于非匹配设计的多因素分析；条件逻辑回归用于匹配设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[病例对照分析策略] --&gt; B{是否匹配?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[非条件逻辑回归]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D[条件逻辑回归]&#10;    C --&gt; E[OR + 95% CI]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    A --&gt; F{需要分层?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[Mantel-Haenszel 方法]&#10;    G --&gt; H[汇总 OR + 同质性检验]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| E\">graph TD\n    A[病例对照分析策略] --&gt; B{是否匹配?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[非条件逻辑回归]\n    B --&gt;|是| D[条件逻辑回归]\n    C --&gt; E[OR + 95% CI]\n    D --&gt; E\n    A --&gt; F{需要分层?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[Mantel-Haenszel 方法]\n    G --&gt; H[汇总 OR + 同质性检验]\n    F --&gt;|否| E</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一项病例对照研究评估手机辐射与脑瘤的关联。200名脑瘤病例中有110名报告过去5年内每天使用手机超过1小时；400名人群对照中有180名有此暴露。计算 OR 及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 置信区间，并讨论可能的回忆偏倚对结果的影响方向。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个嵌套病例对照研究，评估血清维生素 D 水平与结直肠癌发病风险的关联。说明源队列的选择、病例定义、对照采样策略（密度采样 vs 病例-队列）、生物样本的检测时机和混杂控制方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么匹配的病例对照研究必须使用条件逻辑回归而非非条件逻辑回归。如果错误使用非条件回归，估计的 OR 会偏向什么方向？在什么条件下偏倚最严重？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较病例-交叉设计和传统病例对照设计在评估&quot;高温天气触发心肌梗死&quot;假设时的优劣。考虑混杂控制、暴露测量、时间窗口选择和统计效率等维度。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Rothman、Greenland 和 Lash《Modern Epidemiology》中的病例对照研究章节是最权威的方法论参考</li>\n<li>Wacholder 等在 American Journal of Epidemiology 发表的三篇经典论文（&quot;Selection of Controls&quot;系列，1992）系统阐述了对照选择原则</li>\n<li>Maclure（1991）&quot;The Case-Crossover Design: A Method for Studying Transient Effects on the Risk of Acute Events&quot; 是病例-交叉设计的开创性论文</li>\n<li>STROBE 声明为观察性研究（包括病例对照研究）的报告提供了标准化指南</li>\n<li>Breslow 和 Day《Statistical Methods in Cancer Research, Vol. 1》中对病例对照研究的统计方法有深入系统的讲解</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>病例对照研究是流行病学工具箱中最灵活高效的设计之一，在罕见疾病研究、多暴露探索和资源有限场景下具有独特优势。掌握病例对照研究的关键在于理解对照选择的&quot;源人群&quot;原则、识别和控制回忆偏倚与选择偏倚、以及正确选择匹配与非匹配分析策略。从传统设计到密度采样、病例-交叉和两阶段设计，方法学的持续创新使这一经典设计不断焕发新的生命力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 病例对照研究","id":"研究生-临床研究方法-病例对照研究"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"对照选择的方法论","id":"对照选择的方法论"},{"level":3,"text":"偏倚的识别与控制","id":"偏倚的识别与控制"},{"level":3,"text":"高级设计变体","id":"高级设计变体"},{"level":3,"text":"效应量估计与统计分析","id":"效应量估计与统计分析"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 队列研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/study-design/cohort-studies"},"next":{"title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 生存分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/biostatistics/survival-analysis"}}